PhoneBox 0.6.9 — native shell: microphone permission for dictation (android/ only).
- Manifest: RECORD_AUDIO (no other new permission).
- WebChromeClient.onPermissionRequest: grant ONLY RESOURCE_AUDIO_CAPTURE and ONLY for https://appassets.androidplatform.net;
  every other resource / origin / sandboxed iframe -> deny(). Runtime permission is requested on the first dictation press, not at start.
- POST bodies: shouldInterceptRequest never exposes the request body, so the /agent/ proxy forwarded POSTs with 0 bytes. The panel now
  stages the body through the JS bridge (max 2 pending, <= 2 MB + 64 KiB) and the proxy attaches it.

